---
/* 06 · So close. */
import TitleNote from '../../ui/TitleNote.astro';
---
<section class="scene s-close bg-w paper" data-scene data-poster=".7" data-collect="61" style="--len:2.2">
  <div class="pin">
    <i class="close-rip" aria-hidden="true"></i>
    <h2 class="close-h" aria-label="So close."><span data-t="0 1">So</span> <span data-t="0 1">close.</span></h2>
    <TitleNote data-t=".3 .5" class="close-note">Saint Petersburg, 10.07</TitleNote>
    <p class="close-p" data-t=".5 .7">Belgium have the ball for the rest of the night and never find the way through. It is their first defeat in almost two years.</p>
    <p class="mono close-m" data-t=".7 .85">France 1—0 Belgium · Umtiti 51′</p>
  </div>
</section>
